  "body": "The fully-evolved **Argonaut-line generation** inherited into Mantle OS \u2014 the organism grows new reproductive, symbiotic, and self-evolving tissue, every molt gated the same way (no standing law weakened).\n\n## What's inherited\n- **Self/Other** cryptographic identity + **event-gated nociception** (the MIND sleeps until needed) \u2014 hardening the existing organs\n- **Graded memory** \u2014 deweighting / behavioral ghosts\n- **Egg + Hatchery** \u2014 a whole AppAI from one declarative JSON file\n- **Anchoring + Symbiosis** \u2014 residency in a host codebase + a real energy economy\n- **Graft eggs + live residency** \u2014 non-destructive patch-grafts; the static map becomes a pulse\n- **MEM VCW** \u2014 keyless knowledge plasmids (excrete / digest), foreign code only via the sandbox\n- **Self-redesigning VCW + memory bridge** \u2014 a Compiler-class organism re-fits its own genome at rebirth\n- **Ganglia + the seed vault** \u2014 parallel limbs (zero-token telemetry) + self-reconstruction\n- **Resilience** \u2014 usage-based metering, conversation ingestion, and a `doctor` checkup (with a docs-vs-code coherence gate)\n\n## Certification (under Mantle's own gate)\n- **36 \u2192 66 security invariants green**\n- Stage-1 + Stage-2 gates pass; all three tamper proofs still catch (`--break-hash/primer/seal`)\n- The running Field Guide proves **16/16** chapters; `demo` / `hatch` / `graft` / `doctor` green\n- On-disk cube format **unchanged** (`vcw-cube-png-v2`); `selftest` + `interop` pass \u2014 lineage intact\n\n## Reading order\n- [`FIELD_GUIDE.md`](FIELD_GUIDE.md) \u2014 the runnable manual (mirror of `python -m mantle teach`)\n- [`docs/MOLT_LEDGER.md`](docs/MOLT_LEDGER.md) \u2014 the inheritance manifest: per-molt deltas, format/compat verdicts, and a summary table\n\nAlso folds in the in-progress doctrine/doc refresh already present in the tree, and removes `desktop.ini` / `__pycache__` working-tree cruft.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
